{"id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-ground-program-operator.md","title":"有限 ground 正规程序的信息算子","display":"df-finite-ground-program-operator — 有限 ground 正规程序的信息算子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator","aliases":["72-df-finite-ground-program-operator"],"display":"df-finite-ground-program-operator — 有限 ground 正规程序的信息算子","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§2.2,2.6,3.3, print643–644,649–653/PDF655–656,661–665; finite-ground specialization","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"finite source specialization and totality checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_deep":"将有限ground算子的类型、单调性及lower不变量写入断言"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-ground-program-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-ground-program-operator — 有限 ground 正规程序的信息算子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0572b6bbfb593e05\" href=\"?note=0572b6bbfb593e05\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-truth\">72-df-four-valued-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§2.2,2.6,3.3, print643–644,649–653/PDF655–656,661–665; finite-ground specialization"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"finite source specialization and totality checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"将有限ground算子的类型、单调性及lower不变量写入断言"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是有限 ground 关系原子集；字面量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-A\">\\(-A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in H\">\\(A\\in H\\)</span>，其标签互异。P 是有限集，其元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,G\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,G\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in H\">\\(A\\in H\\)</span>、G 为这些字面量的有限序列；不含等式或变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>四值及其信息次序取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0572b6bbfb593e05\" href=\"?note=0572b6bbfb593e05\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-truth\">72-df-four-valued-truth</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lv},\\operatorname{bv},\\mathcal T_P\">\\(\\operatorname{lv},\\operatorname{bv},\\mathcal T_P\\)</span> 由下式给出，非空有限逻辑合取、析取沿用四值运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>新增比较输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\">\\(J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\sqsubseteq J\">\\(I\\sqsubseteq J\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in H\\ (I(A)\\sqsubseteq J(A))\">\\(\\forall A\\in H\\ (I(A)\\sqsubseteq J(A))\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lv}_I(A)&amp;:=I(A),\\quad\\operatorname{lv}_I(-A):=\\sim I(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bv}_I(G)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&amp;|G|=0,\\\\\\bigwedge^4_{i&lt;|G|}\\operatorname{lv}_I(G_i),&amp;0&lt;|G|,\\end{cases}\\\\\nP_A&amp;:=\\{G:\\langle A,G\\rangle\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;P_A=\\varnothing,\\\\\\bigvee^4_{G\\in P_A}\\operatorname{bv}_I(G),&amp;P_A\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lv}_I(A)&amp;:=I(A),\\quad\\operatorname{lv}_I(-A):=\\sim I(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bv}_I(G)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&amp;|G|=0,\\\\\\bigwedge^4_{i&lt;|G|}\\operatorname{lv}_I(G_i),&amp;0&lt;|G|,\\end{cases}\\\\\nP_A&amp;:=\\{G:\\langle A,G\\rangle\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&amp;P_A=\\varnothing,\\\\\\bigvee^4_{G\\in P_A}\\operatorname{bv}_I(G),&amp;P_A\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_P:\\mathsf{Four}^H\\to\\mathsf{Four}^H,\\qquad\nI\\sqsubseteq J\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal T_P(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_P:\\mathsf{Four}^H\\to\\mathsf{Four}^H,\\qquad\nI\\sqsubseteq J\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal T_P(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空 body 为真，没有该 head 的子句时定义式为空析取、取假。后者是完成定义信息算子，不是普通正 Horn 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P(I)\">\\(T_P(I)\\)</span> 真原子集合：两者签名和值域不同，本节点用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_P\">\\(\\mathcal T_P\\)</span> 区分。每个聚合有限，分支覆盖且互斥。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：字面量否定交换证据坐标，有限合取、析取的各坐标为min/max，因此对信息序单调。low={u,t,f}对这些逻辑运算封闭，两个空聚合单位t、f也在low中，所以从全u开始的迭代不会产生冲突值c。注意这里不是一般low信息上确界闭合的主张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0572b6bbfb593e05","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0572b6bbfb593e05","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"四值及其信息次序取 [[72-df-four-valued-truth]]；$I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H$。$\\operatorname{lv},\\operatorname{bv},\\mathcal T_P$ 由下式给出，非空有限逻辑合取、析取沿用四值运算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"-A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,G\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lv},\\operatorname{bv},\\mathcal T_P","display":false},{"tex":"J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H","display":false},{"tex":"I\\sqsubseteq J","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in H\\ (I(A)\\sqsubseteq J(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{lv}_I(A)&:=I(A),\\quad\\operatorname{lv}_I(-A):=\\sim I(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{bv}_I(G)&:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf t,&|G|=0,\\\\\\bigwedge^4_{i<|G|}\\operatorname{lv}_I(G_i),&0<|G|,\\end{cases}\\\\\nP_A&:=\\{G:\\langle A,G\\rangle\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T_P(I)(A)&:=\\begin{cases}\\mathsf f,&P_A=\\varnothing,\\\\\\bigvee^4_{G\\in P_A}\\operatorname{bv}_I(G),&P_A\\ne\\varnothing.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_P:\\mathsf{Four}^H\\to\\mathsf{Four}^H,\\qquad\nI\\sqsubseteq J\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal T_P(J).","display":true},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal T_P(I)\\in\\mathsf{Four}_{\\rm low}^H.","display":true},{"tex":"T_P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_P","display":false}],"bytes":2798,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-545","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-540","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-s